1. Heat the food in the microwave.
   ```(:goal (and (heated food)))```

2. Move the heated food to the living room.
   ```(:goal (and (item_at food livingroom)))```

3. Place the heated food on the desk in the living room.
   ```(:goal (and (item_on food desk)))```

4. Move the water bottle to the living room.
   ```(:goal (and (item_at water_bottle livingroom)))```

5. Place the water bottle on the desk in the living room.
   ```(:goal (and (item_on water_bottle desk)))```

6. Store the eggs in the egg container.
   ```(:goal (and (item_in eggs egg_container)))```